== Missing response files
#1 (Fatal Error) Improper use of `-a' option.  Type `aldor -help' for help.
#1 (Fatal Error) Improper use of `-a' option.  Type `aldor -help' for help.
== Empty response files
#1 (Warning) No files!  Type `aldor -help' for help.
#1 (Warning) No files!  Type `aldor -help' for help.
Exec: aldor -laxllib -K9 -vO empty.as
== Non-empty response files
Exec: aldor -laxllib -v triv1.as
Exec: aldor -lm -laxllib -Grun -v triv1.as
== Multiple response files
Exec: aldor -laxllib -v -lm -G run -D HiSteve -U HowdySam triv1.as
== Nested response files
Exec: aldor -laxllib -v -lm -Grun -D HiSteve -U HowdySam triv1.as
== "a" inside a bad argument does not imply a response file
`-T' is not an option.  Type `aldor -help' for help.
== ALDORARGS environment variable
Exec: aldor -v -Fc -laxllib zippo.as
zippo.as
zippo.c
Exec: aldor -laxllib -v -Fc -Flsp zippo.as
zippo.arf
zippo.as
zippo.c
zippo.lsp
